{"v":4,"catch":"摧毀目標並瞄準出口！","desc":"“RAIDERS5”是UPL於1985年發行的射擊益智遊戲。\n玩家旨在通過摧毀舞台上的所有目標來逃脫。 找到出口！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-05-21","genres":["射擊","益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89bf93cd4d29227d28a3c0d4b2a8e5ec9130f868359530103dcc4a3565200a5d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/960018d1889da9575b8898bddca1be52a095ee7c22c9a5f524348b847b9ae46c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3239fe34c7f4b7bea9f76ef270a95d8acd33ecf83a3777f6da8af10586296fcd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3436b8063d84e3d6b3203b7a96e048de4507f84416cd361f5157fd03d471c228.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6751bccad9d746874ed24fdc4440e309b41312dcd28914c271d65f3758e4deee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/56d80cea2882fba78c65311662420022d4076a51d2ee325ac9b2a28009808541.jpg"],"titleId":"0100dc4009828000","dlc":[]}